Please first download the dataset and place it in the repository root directory.

Each subfolder corresponds to one mixture class, and each .csv file contains one spectral sample.

Usage
1. Generate labels
Run:python label_generate.py

This will generate:EAI_label.csv

The label file contains the sample information, class index, and the corresponding ethanol, acetone, and IPA concentrations.

2. Train the neural network

Run:python ml_pc.py

The script trains a 1D CNN classifier for liquid-mixture classification. The network consists of one 4 × 4 convolution layer followed by three fully connected layers.
The training results, including the trained model, training history, classification report, prediction results, and confusion matrix, will be saved automatically.
